injector.exe "path\to\dll.dll"  # Specify DLL
```

**Key finding - SDL2 is statically linked**:
- Module enumeration shows NO SDL2.dll loaded
- SDL2 functions are embedded in Horsey.exe
- IAT hooking SDL2 won't work - need to hook internal functions instead

**Hook target options**:
1. Main function: RVA 0x21ED0C (in-memory: base + 0x21ED0C)
2. RenderFrame: RVA 0x11E0F0 (in-memory: base + 0x11E0F0)
