# Horsey Game Reverse Engineering Progress
## Phase 1: Initial Reconnaissance
### 1.1 Game File Inventory
- Root directory files: [RE_Tools/analysis/file_inventory_root.txt](RE_Tools/analysis/file_inventory_root.txt)
