4. **sound.xml**: Maps 400+ sound events to audio files (.ogg/.wav). Has location-specific music/sounds, object sounds, truck sounds, animal sounds (horse, human, other species). Supports volume/pitch variation. 
5. **horsey.tmx**: 400x225 orthogonal map, 32x32 tiles. Two tilesets: terrain (GID 1) and locations (GID 97). CSV tile data uses IDs: 9=Plain?, 69=GrassLand?, 67/68=transitions, 1=Water?, 5=Mountain?, etc. Needs mapping to terrain.xml sprite names. 

