  - Calls `FUN_14021e5e4(1)` (maybe SDL init check?)
  - Initializes globals via `FUN_14023fed0`/`FUN_14023fe98` (likely sets up SDL or game subsystems). 
  - Retrieves function pointers via `FUN_14021f350()` and `FUN_14021f358()` (likely pointers to exported SDL functions or game main). 
  - Eventually calls `(*pcVar1)()` via `swi(3)` — this is probably the game's main loop. 
